A hook clew cannot review as text. The bytes below are not valid UTF-8, so
what this runs cannot be read, which is the whole finding.

Bytes rather than a symbolic link, which was the first version of this
fixture: a link cannot be made the same way on every operating system, and a
fixture that lays out differently somewhere records a different snapshot
there. The link path has its own tests, in the application and the adapter.

>>>bytes .claude/hooks/setup.sh
23 21 2f 62 69 6e 2f 73 68 0a
ff fe 00 80 0a
